{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14105190","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14105190","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1410519001:1":{"text":"Oh my...","source_cn":"这、这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97C982BA31738978","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410519002:1":{"text":"Zanie, do you have any idea what these are for?","source_cn":"这些机械有什么作用吗？祖娅，你应该能看得出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x134B18514BCA68D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410519003:1":{"text":"These are finely designed extraction devices... used to pull contents from the oval-shaped ores placed above.","source_cn":"这些是设计精良的提取分离装置……用来从上方的椭圆形矿石...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC492E9D3D19B412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410519004:1":{"text":"Look, each device has two output ports. The ore's contents get funneled through pipes, and the ore itself gets crushed, then sent off to the mine carts.","source_cn":"你们看，这些机械都有两个输出口。矿石中的内容物经由管道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x117E5578BD3C5130","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410519005:1":{"text":"I don't understand...","source_cn":"我不明白……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BCD0571D16872C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410519006:1":{"text":"Hmmm... Are you saying that these aren't regular ores?","source_cn":"是啊，我也不太明白。矿石中的内容物？这种椭圆的矿石……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x281B277785466D48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410519007:1":{"text":"No, not that!","source_cn":"我说的不是这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC81FDE03CB08568","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410519008:1":{"text":"My point is, the magic here feels just like the Divine Dew... only way more potent!","source_cn":"这里流动的魔力，与恩典灵露的气息如出一辙……甚至更加浓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C1C59879A27360B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410519009:1":{"text":"Come again?!","source_cn":"什么，小子！你再说一次？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FF0D9717752EAFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410519010:1":{"text":"This machine's full of magic even stronger than the Divine Dew! It's like it's been blessed by the gods themselves!","source_cn":"这个巨大的机械里，竟然藏着比恩典灵露更馥郁的魔力！仿佛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35344F017C323BA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410519011:1":{"text":"Wait, what? Could it be...?","source_cn":"灵露的魔力……难、难道说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D598524CD64341","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1410519011":{"text":"Wait, what? Could it be...?","source_cn":"灵露的魔力……难、难道说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D598524CD64341","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410519012:1":{"text":"No... it's gotta be more complicated than that. I need to take a closer look!","source_cn":"不……肯定没有你说的那么简单，我要走近点看看！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCE99F9BF546CA5DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"No... it's gotta be more complicated than that. I need to take a closer look!","female":"No... it's gotta be more complicated than that. I need to take a closer look!","variant_male_record_index":"157668","variant_female_record_index":"157669","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"What are you thinking?","source_cn":"你想到什么了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBCD8EDCDDB725CA2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What are you thinking?","female":"What are you thinking?","variant_male_record_index":"71548","variant_female_record_index":"71549","document_title":"","do